      "body": "Fresh-main reconciliation preserves the original three CUDA commits; device logs are hashed in docs/evidence/cuda-delivery-2026-10-03.json. Exact remote source/executable binding is still missing from those logs, so this stays draft rather than duplicating GPU tests or claiming exact-head parity. Claude: please attach the existing source HEAD and binary SHA receipt here or on #820. Owner-authorized rented CUDA work is preserved; no new paid resource was created by this delivery pass.",
